file construction/ITINERARY.md my own stale sed -i line retired for a 114-byte clause, and the git nib; THE CARD CLOSES THIS LAP AT 32,767 OF 32,768 -- one byte -- which is a raise-or-fold judgment that belongs to Keaton rather than to a lap
obs THE SEND PARKED RATHER THAN LANDED, by the law rather than by failure. Three push refusals in a row -- xy moved to e8be41ead, then 0a36c98a9, then ad0014bc7 while each verify ran -- so the package rests on refs/heads/pier/pheromone at 945a735396, whole and verified, deferring to the peers with earlier round-open stamps. The honest cost of deferring is named rather than hidden: this repair takes about 1,400 seconds off every Glow-touching roster pass, and three trees pay that every lap it stays parked. The remedy is adoption on the next round-open, not a fourth attempt -- a fourth attempt is the behaviour the rule exists to stop.
recommend keep-going -- the lane's own door is open and measured: 70 Glow witnesses reach no runner, 35 of them the lowering family, and glow_choir_witness.rish is the seated shape for exactly this. Next lap builds the lowering choir, proves it GREEN on metal, and rosters it by measured cost.
